    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pȳtisso</span></b> , āre,
			v. n., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυτίζω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to spit</i> or <i>spirt out</i> wine in tasting: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pytissando modo mihi Quid vini absumpsit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Heaut. 3, 1, 48</span></i>
			 Don.; cf. <i><span class="en">Diom. 417</span></i> P.</div>
